ened to be in the way. And you think that the dealer will say, "Oh, no, no more for you until you've calmed down."?<BR>REPLY TO 3<BR>LEAGALIZE AND MAKE DOC's BE DEALERS [like england did]and mob will need a new money source EVER SEE A BEERWAR NOW they had them in the 20's under stupid christians laws about booze bans that didnot work<P>We need more rational (read, permissive) laws in this country like we need more, well, liberals. That strategy's done so well for the anti-gun lobbyists.<BR>REPLY<BR>GUN NUT BS, LIKE ASH[HOLE]CROFTS BS<P>What we need is self control. As rayb put it so succinctly, we can't legislate it. We have to teach it. We have to practice it. We need to uphold it. And if we do, our legislators will finally be able to say, "See? One of our programs worked! Let's take more money from the people and give it to someone else."</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><BR>NEVER HAVE NEVER WILL "WORK' BUT WILL SPREAD PLAGE FASTER THATS WHY CHRISTIANS AND RATIONAL LAWS DO NOT PLAY TOGETTER AT ALL.<BR>SOS DOES NOT WORK IF YOU THINK YOU CAN PREYAWAY AIDS YOUR ARE WRONG DANGERISLY WRONG.<P>------------------<BR>Question wonder and be wierd<p>[This message has been edited by ray b (edited 12-19-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000012||Patrick's Dad||12-19-2001||06:54 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by ray b:<BR><B><BR>REPLY TO 1<BR>WELL fundies JUST SAY NO for religios reasons<BR>and want to ban SEX ed tooooo.<BR> <BR>I WANT RATIONAL LAWS to control a plage not preying on the victom as sinners but fundies WILL SCREAM NO NO NO and let the PLAGE SPREAD instead of trying to stop it.<BR>JUST SAY NO IS A FAILURE WAKE UP</B> <HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>So you're saying that funding weapons training, esp. for criminals, will reduce or eliminate innocent deaths. The analogy, if not immediately clear, is that by showing those that we do not want to utilize the mode of harm how to use it more effectively, then this will act as a deterrant. rayb, you'll never need to remind me not to vote for you.<P> <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR> <B>REPLY TO 2<BR>NO THING IS 100% except HEAD IN SAND 100% failure that we do now THATS A 100% WAY TO SPREAD PLAGE COST WOULD BE LESS BUT CHRISTIANS DO NOT CARE ABOUT COST OF THEIR MORALS ONLY SIN.</B> <HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>So, to futher this analogy, *what's* the cost of killing people?<P>Giving people handouts for doing what is bad/wrong/evil has got to be the most moronic thing that I've ever heard of. I'm sure my son will grow up to be an upstanding citizen if I start giving him candy for hitting his sister, and "Good job, Buddy!" for breaking her toys.<P>OTOH, stealing is quite rare in the Middle East, where they cut off a person's hand for taking something that isn't theirs.<P> <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR> <B> REPLY TO 3<BR>LEAGALIZE AND MAKE DOC's BE DEALERS [like england did]and mob will need a new money source EVER SEE A BEERWAR NOW they had them in the 20's under stupid christians laws about booze bans that didnot work </B> <HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Oh, and I'm sure that (even some) doctors won't abuse this power at all. Hey they get to kill people in Scandanavia, but they *never* do it for their own purposes.<P> <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR> <B> REPLY<BR>GUN NUT BS, LIKE ASH[HOLE]CROFTS BS </B> <HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Ah, yes. Name calling. The last resort of the, well, I won't say. Be careful ray, many on this forum are gun nuts. I'm just a Constitution nut and I'm sick of people like you, Ted Kennedy (my senator, unfortunately) and Tom Daschle trying to weaken and ignore it. The Bill of Rights is called that for a reason.<P> <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR> <B><BR>NEVER HAVE NEVER WILL "WORK' BUT WILL SPREAD PLAGE FASTER THATS WHY CHRISTIANS AND RATIONAL LAWS DO NOT PLAY TOGETTER AT ALL.<BR>SOS DOES NOT WORK IF YOU THINK YOU CAN PREYAWAY AIDS YOUR ARE WRONG DANGERISLY WRONG.<BR></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Huh? Again....<P>If I properly decode that last one, I think that George Washington, once appointed King of America (He declined), said it best:<P><B>"The propitious smiles of Heaven can never be expected on a nation that disregards the eternal rules of order and right which Heaven itself has ordained."</B><P>1789 Inaugural Address<BR>||||reg||1
Z||000013||TRiAD||12-19-2001||07:50 PM||||I see ray is at it again...it's Harry Potter all over again...mark my words. <P><BR> <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by ray b:<BR><B>1959 was first case of hiv/AIDS checked in90's test of blood saved, 19 year old victom died quickly and they saved blood for research.<BR>chic to chic transmission very rare only one case known, something in spit kills hiv.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Never heard that about saliva, but whatever, don't know about the rest...<P><B> <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>not polio vaccine or germ war bug but came from siv from monkeys that people in central africa eat under/un cooked to get it first.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Oh, so now you were there, and know that some guy didn't have relations with a monkey? I'm not saying you're wrong, I wasn't there either, but it seems to me you're trying to find a PC way for AIDS to have been first contracted in man. It's called an <B>STD</B> for a reason. The only way you could contract it by eating <B>(especially since you tell us saliva KILLS AIDS?!0</B> would be if you 1)don't eat using saliva, and 2)have an openn wound in your mouth?!<BR>Whatever, Ray, you've already terminally contradicted yourself.<P><B> <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>3,000,000 in africa died of AIDS in 2000 or twice as many total dead people then died on 9-11 attack EACH AND EVERY DAY for years. with no end in sight.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Reference? Source for your numbers? I didn't think so.<P><BR><B> <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Warondrugs/stupid-laws/religios nuts all help spread by not helping control spread by free condums in schools. and needels for junkusers on the street NO WE CAN'T DO THATERS are still at it. like instead of control of sexforsale<BR>lets pass stupid laws and jail girls and hope AIDS goes away instead of free help to give them freesshit if infected to keep them off the working streets.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P><B><FONT COLOR="red">Ray's "Rational" Laws;<P>1) Give the kiddies free condoms as early as possible, since that's the ONLY way to keep them from getting AIDS from eachother.<P>2) Give ALL junkies free NEEDLES, instead of free HELP to GET OFF THE DRUGS, since nothing works, life is hopeless, and they're just going to keep being junkies anyway...<P>3) Give all prostitutes FREE EVERYHING. Give them FULL benefits and EVERYTHING paid for by the government, so they'll stay off the streets. If they seem like they're going to go back to the street anyway, GIVE THEM MORE!</B></FONT><P>Ray, you must be the single most LIBERAL person I've ever come across. I've never heard anything so incredibly absurd. Your complete and utter contempt for ANYTHING regarding civization baffles me. <BR> <BR><B> <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>THATS WHY LAWS NEED TO be RATIONAL and revised offten and never gods.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Why not God's laws? <BR>"Do not kill". Yeah, I can see where you'd have a problem with that...<BR>"Do not commit adultry". Yep, another "danger to society", this one is. <BR>"Do not steal". Wow, you know what ray, you're on to something here...this God must be pure evil! He MUST be STOPPED!<BR>"Do not lie". I am in awe of the thought that anyone could expect people to follow this!<BR>"Do not covet your neighbor's wife". Wow...this God is a danger to our entire way of life!<BR>"Honor your parents". Man, what next? This is inhumane! <P>yeah, Ray...start a movement to save us from God's aweful laws...puhleeese.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/rolleyes.gif"><P><P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://communities.msn.com/_Secure/0NgAAAMsSN*Wryq60N*CeWB!hXjfeIaMEc1YxPH9aPzaIXm!17ZpdBFE0Yk*d*dHNFG*GR3SFyLa8KJgh1IKe2Q/xmas-sig.jpg">       <BR><B><I><FONT COLOR="red">Merry Christmas!</