Z||000022||TRiAD||12-20-2001||02:18 PM||||  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by 84Bill:<BR><B>...Laws and religion <BR>all they do is protect the weak and invade our right to live and do as we damn well please. Ok some do make sense like going to jail for murder...</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>You're already doing it, too. What if someone "damn well pleases" to kill you? You're making laws to protect yourself from him, aren't you? You're drawing a line just like those you're persecuting. Yours is just more liberal. <P>  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR><B>...And for you god fearing types that run around preaching this and that, yall are sinners regardless of your prefrences anyway so worry about yourself and leave the rest alone...</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Uh, when did anyone claim we were perfect? You're right. We are sinners. We try not to be, with His help, but how's that hurt you?<P><B>  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>...I'm just so tired of all this Oh the lord is the way and The law is the way to live decent and the book of the lord is the law and law is law.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>So turn off Robert Tilton already!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><BR>Seriously, who jams this stuff down your throat? You're not the only person to claim this, but no one has an answer...show me your oppressor. <P>  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR><B>...The very second you were concieved you are as good as dead it's just a matter of time...</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>This is news? hehe<P><B>  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>...Oh but this is the "modern age" where weak minded stupid assez can make the laws and "protect" themselves from the natural ebb of life itself.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>And you've benefited from that way of life by living in a country where you're allowed to have that very belief. As you said, "the natural ebb of life itself" would have swallowed you up at a young age, as well. Or are you just better than everyone else?<P><B>  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>...Ok we need a law damnit because I'm stupid!</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>That's about right, but it's true. No, I'm not calling you stupid, but really, in the day-to-day, most people are, aren't they? That's why we have more than just a handful of laws...morons come in and say "yeah, but what about ___? There's no law against THAT?!", so BAM! New law. <P><B>  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>...I my history serves me right the United States was formed on the very right for people to practice any religeon they want any way they want (just don't kill any chickens for gods sake    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/mad.gif"> ) This is just fine with me I have no problem with your beliefs at all EXCEPT when you ride my asz and call me a sinner and / or tell me what I should or shouldn't believe in.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Like I said above, who is harping on you? No one should be. Now, there are laws, there is morality, and there is religion. If you want to avoid them, avoid them. Now, breaking the law may get you busted, but as far as I know, no one's going to call you on not following morality or religion. <P><B>  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Hey yer gunna die, enjoy and let others choose how to enjoy themselves. I know I will    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"> </B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>But you're complaining about other people's religions! Aren't they entitled to their beliefs as well?!<P>This is what's wrong with all the anti-religious liberal dribble here; it all boils down to one thing...<P><I>"Everyone is entitled to believe whatever they want, as long as they don't believe in God, and as long as I don't ever have to know what they believe. I, on the other hand, can spout my beliefs with impunity."</I><P>Yeah, THAT'S equality and fairness...   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/rolleyes.gif"><P><p>[This message has been edited by TRiAD (edited 12-20-2001).]||||reg||1
